            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "A1qhG",
              "name": "F · Edge cases",
              "width": 560,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r8EgjC",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$g-text",
                  "content": "F · Edge cases (how it behaves)",
                  "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "800"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "xz2mH",
                  "name": "List",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "$g-panel",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "padding": [
                    18,
                    20
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eHVY3",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Follow off: it flies only to changes on the page you're on. Follow on: it also takes you to the page, switching class if needed.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "B2w08",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• You go to another page yourself: Follow turns off (\"Stopped following\"). You're typing or a dialog is open: it waits, then catches up 3 s after you stop.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "HlNOy",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Bursts: it visits each change about 0.6 s apart. If more than 5 pile up, it shows one bubble (\"Added 8 deadlines\") and everything new glows at once.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "snk9j",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Change is off-screen: with Follow on it scrolls there; with Follow off it flies to the edge of the screen and points.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "N5JvRz",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Item is deleted: it visits the item, the item fades out, then it returns.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vxe0z",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Two agents: still one Halley; the bubble names the agent (\"Codex · Reading 06_Counting.pdf\").",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "u7h9K",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• No agent connected: Sleepy, resting in its corner. The panel says \"Waiting for your agent: run /godspeed:teach\".",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vrOiT",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Job fails: @_@ for a moment, and the job shows its error in the panel.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "EYL3T",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Reduce motion is on (system setting): it jumps instead of flying, with no trail or bobbing.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "VOtmW",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Narrow window: it shrinks to 40px and its bubble shortens to just the verb.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "o2oUU",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• You can drag it to any corner; it remembers the corner. The name Halley can be changed in Settings; it's only on screen, and the agent's prompts stay the same.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
