                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "f6eFfC",
                  "x": 440,
                  "y": 260,
                  "name": "Rosen 7.1 p3",
                  "width": 340,
                  "fill": "#0B0B0B",
                  "stroke": "#3A3A3A",
                  "strokeWidth": 1,
                  "effect": [
                    {
                      "type": "shadow",
                      "shadowType": "outer",
                      "color": "#000000",
                      "offset": {
                        "x": 0,
                        "y": 20
                      },
                      "blur": 50
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "shadow",
                      "shadowType": "outer",
                      "color": "#FFFFFF14",
                      "blur": 40
                    }
                  ],
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "padding": 24,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "C57Ero",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "#D9D9D9",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Complements and Unions of Events",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "STIX Two Text",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "hNrn2",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                      "effect": {
                        "type": "shadow",
                        "shadowType": "outer",
                        "color": "#FFFFFF66",
                        "blur": 14
                      },
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Theorem 1. Let E be an event in a sample space S. The probability of the complement of E is p(Ē) = 1 − p(E).",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "STIX Two Text",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "w73bHf",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "#5A5A5A",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Proof. Note that |Ē| = |S| − |E|. Hence p(Ē) = (|S| − |E|) / |S| = 1 − p(E).",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "STIX Two Text",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Feorg",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "#1C1C1C",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Example 10. A sequence of 10 bits is chosen at random. What is the probability that at least one of these bits is 0?",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "STIX Two Text",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "PDu8a",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "#1C1C1C",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Theorem 2. Let E1 and E2 be events in S. Then p(E1 ∪ E2) = p(E1) + p(E2) − p(E1 ∩ E2).",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "STIX Two Text",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
