          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KlA9e",
              "name": "Motion head",
              "fill": "#E6E6E6",
              "content": "How it moves",
              "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "nWWZo",
              "name": "Motion line",
              "fill": "#8D8D8D",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The pages scroll slowly through the whole file on their own, then ease back to the page the agent is on. It is decoration, not the agent's real scroll.",
              "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i6v5ZD",
              "name": "Motion line",
              "fill": "#8D8D8D",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The page stack floats: it drifts a few pixels and tilts by less than a degree on a slow, uneven loop, so it never sits dead still.",
              "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "J0a1q",
              "name": "Motion line",
              "fill": "#8D8D8D",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "When a step finishes, it slides up in the list and the next one fades in. When a plan item is done, its check draws in.",
              "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "gy6Xx",
      "x": 2988,
      "y": 28950,
      "name": "10 · Class identity: pick a direction",
      "fill": "#000000",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 28,
      "padding": 48,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l60hd",
          "name": "Board title",
          "fill": "#E6E6E6",
          "content": "10 · Every class looks like itself: pick a direction",
          "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WnrRx",
          "name": "Board note",
          "fill": "#8D8D8D",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1300,
          "content": "Today every class page is the same: a name, one line, the same cards. Four directions, each on CSE 21 and CSE 29. They can be combined. Not shown: a color per class, because color in godspeed already means confidence (a red class would read as \"bad\").",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "gOZ86",
          "name": "Row A",
          "gap": 32,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "IoOCq",
              "name": "Explain",
              "width": 340,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 14,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RsuAK",
                  "name": "Option",
                  "fill": "$g-text",
                  "content": "A · Signature",
                  "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "pXoTP",
                  "name": "What you see",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 4,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "i7AAKk",
                      "name": "h",
                      "fill": "$g-text-3",
                      "content": "What you see",
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LsELP",
                      "name": "b",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The class's own symbol beside its name: a formula for a math class, a line of code for a C class, a line from the text for a literature class. A small form of it becomes the class's mark in the sidebar and on Home.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "MeDoy",
                  "name": "What the agent does",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 4,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ktzRi",
                      "name": "h",
                      "fill": "$g-text-3",
                      "content": "What the agent does",
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "y5l57y",
                      "name": "b",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Once, while setting up the class, it picks one line that sums up the subject and saves it (update_class gets a \"signature\" field). You can change it in Edit class.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "wDOYq",
                  "name": "Cost",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 4,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Jxa7I",
                      "name": "h",
                      "fill": "$g-text-3",
                      "content": "Cost",
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "HT4Cn",
                      "name": "b",
                      "fill": "$g-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "One tool call per class, ever.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "PRipH",
