                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Under the name, the term as a line of units. Each unit's bar fills white as you study it, so the line is your progress through the course. Halley sits on today's spot with a short note about this week. The signature is a small stamp by the name.",
